    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">🔄</div>
      <h3>Resurfacing &amp; Repairs</h3>
      <p>Resurface aging pavement and repair potholes before they spread.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">🛡️</div>
      <h3>Sealcoating</h3>
      <p>Premium seal coating to protect your investment from weather and wear.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">⬜</div>
