      <p>Full-service parking lot upkeep — plowing, striping, sealing, repair.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="text-center mt-3">
    <a href="/services" class="btn btn-primary">View Full Services &amp; Photos</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="callout">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Serving PA, MD &amp; WV.</h2>
    <p>Decades of experience. Honest work. Get in touch and we'll come take a look.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
